          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: بڑھاپا",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "بڑھاپا — buṛhāpā — \"old age\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "بڑھاپے میں نیند کم ہو جاتی ہے۔ buṛhāpe meṅ nīṅd kam ho jātī hai. In old age people sleep less."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "بڑھاپا (buṛhāpā) is inherited: it is built on بوڑھا, \"old\", from buḍḍha, a form CDIAL reconstructs (CDIAL 9271), with the abstract ending -āpā."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for describing what you lived and felt."
